Table full name: TCGA.TCGA_VERSIONED.RNASEQ_HG38_GDC_R39
Column name: project_short_name Type: TEXT Description: Project name abbreviation; the program name appended with a project name abbreviation; eg. TCGA-OV, etc.
Column name: gene_type Type: TEXT Description: The type of genetic element the reads mapped to, eg. protein_coding, ribozyme
